">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">西门子联手英伟达应用Veloce系统，将AI芯片前硅设计验证周期缩短至数日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">西门子与英伟达近日宣布在AI芯片验证领域达成深度合作，通过软硬协同技术，将芯片前硅设计验证周期从数月大幅缩短至数日。该方案核心采用西门子Veloce™ proFPGA CS硬件辅助验证系统，配合英伟达深度优化的芯片架构进行实战模拟。通过在首版芯片交付制造前运行数万亿次循环的大规模真实工作负载，双方实现了对设计方案的提前“试错”与优化。此次合作旨在通过EDA工具链的数字化孪生技术，显著提升AI芯片的流片成功率并缩短上市时间（TTM）。对于行业而言，这一技术突破不仅规避了高昂的返工成本，更为下一代AI算力集群的快速落地提供了底层保障，标志着工业软件在加速AI硬件创新进程中发挥了关键作用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团斩获CVPR 2026两项冠军，实现AIGC检测技术实战级跃迁</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6a01cf851f6683de7de460ae590134a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团在计算机视觉顶会CVPR 2026 NTIRE挑战赛中，斩获“复杂真实场景鲁棒性样本测试”与“人脸增强异常检测”双赛道冠军。针对Deepfake与AIGC滥用风险，蚂蚁AI安全实验室基于DINOv3视觉基础模型，提出双流并行集成架构，通过模拟多重失真退化效果，显著提升了模型在真实场景下的鲁棒性。团队创新引入“Locate-Then-Examine”两阶段检测范式，不仅能识别AI生成内容，还能定位伪造瑕疵并生成文本解释，突破了传统“黑盒”检测局限。该技术已应用于支付、金融身份认证及EKYC等场景，为防范深度伪造攻击提供核心保障。此外，蚂蚁集团已在GitHub开源AIGC图像视频检测资源仓库，助力行业共同应对安全挑战。此次夺冠标志着蚂蚁集团在AI安全领域的检测能力已从实验室环境成功跨越至复杂实战场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8463332e50e07be255cca58cf0c03ac7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯Robotics X实验室联合腾讯混元团队正式发布具身智能基础模型HY-Embodied-0.5，旨在解决通用视觉语言模型在物理世界交互中的感知与控制痛点。该系列包含MoT-2B（总参4B，激活2B）与MoE-32B（总参407B，激活32B）两款模型，采用首创的视觉与语言模态非共享参数的混合Transformer架构，并配合HY-ViT2.0视觉编码器。模型基于超1亿条具身专属数据训练，通过拒绝采样微调、强化学习及在线蒸馏等策略优化。性能方面，MoT-2B在感知、推理、规划等22项权威评测中斩获16项最佳，超越Qwen3-VL-4B及RoboBrain2.5等同参数竞品；旗舰版MoE-32B综合表现可对标Gemini3.0Pro。实机测试显示，该模型在机器人打包、堆叠等任务中表现优异，为具身智能从虚拟仿真</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6eed16a7e538262afb05d56267905cf5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">教育部、国家发展改革委、工业和信息化部、科技部及国家数据局联合印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》，明确将由国家统一开发覆盖全学段的AI慕课资源。该计划旨在构建全民AI素养培育机制，确保教育资源公平。在实施路径上，基础教育阶段AI课程将设为地方必修课；高等教育阶段将AI纳入公共基础课程体系，并增设微专业与微证书；职业教育则侧重培养适配产业智能转型的高技能人才。此外，国家智慧教育平台将上线免费AI通识课，集成智能导学、个性化路径规划及AI伴学等技术。此举标志着我国人工智能人才培养进入体系化阶段，通过供给侧改革重塑劳动力结构。预计到2030年，人工智能将从精英工具转化为社会基础性技能，为我国在全球AI竞争中储备深厚的人才池与应用生态基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布Muse Spark模型，推动Meta AI应用跃升至App Store第五名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4f4fe424bc7d4464a7e82b11016ac757.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布由前Scale AI负责人Alexandr Wang领导开发的最新AI模型Muse Spark，该模型支持语音、文本和图像多模态输入，具备处理健康、科学、数学复杂问题及视觉编程能力，并支持启用多个子代理协同工作。受此驱动，Meta AI应用在美国App Store排名从第57名飙升至第5名。Appfigures数据显示，发布首日Meta AI在美国iOS平台下载量达4.6万次，环比增长87%；4月8日其美国日均网站访问量激增超450%。目前，Meta AI全球总下载量已达6050万，印度为最大市场。Meta计划将Muse Spark陆续集成至WhatsApp、Instagram、Facebook、Messenger及AI眼镜等平台，并同步更新移动端与网页版以支持任务模式切换。尽管增长迅速，其行业</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
